# Tus uploads

- One mount: `/files` (`TusConfig.PATH`).
- Client metadata must include shared enum `UploadType` (never ad-hoc strings).
- `TusHandlerRegistry` maps `UploadType` → `{ onUploadCreate, onUploadFinish }`.
- On create: `ensureDiskHeadroomFor`, validate domain row; on finish: claim + `promote` (idempotent).
- Adding a kind = new `UploadType` member in `@repo/shared` (`uploads/enums/`) + register handler.
